  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "多分支文本事件让每个选择同时改变英雄处境与魔王自身状态。",
      "dimension": "故事",
      "excerpt": "The multifaceted text events contain numerous branches, with every choice you make having consequences that affect both the heroes and the player!",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3170730/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "地牢内的哥布林、邪教徒、蜥蜴人与鼠人四派态度不一，需要处理内部统治关系。",
      "dimension": "故事",
      "excerpt": "Under your dominion reside four factions: Goblins, Cultists, Lizards, and Ratfolks. Not all of them are pleased with your rule...",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3170730/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "除正面战斗外，还能让英雄挨饿、腐化心智、降低士气或制造阴谋与内讧。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Kill the heroes in battle, vanquish them in your domain, let them starve, corrupt their minds, lower their morale, orchestrate conspiracies, and sow discord among travelers!",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3170730/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
